<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπογρᾰφ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>register, list,</i> of lands or
			property, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				745d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				850d
			</span></i>, etc.; of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεντηκοστολόγοι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				34.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τῆς οὐσίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					2.476.14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφήβων</span>
			<u>CIG</u>(add.)<i><span class="en">
				1997c
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>); <i>list</i> of moneys claimed by the state from private
			persons, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				17.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>register of persons liable to taxation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Luc.
				2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				18.1.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κατ᾽ οἰκίαν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					2.260.79
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, etc.; of the Roman <i>census-lists,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
				16
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>muster-roll</i> of soldiers, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.23.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> generally,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀπογραφῆς λέγειν</span> from
				<i>a written list,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sotad.Com.
				1.35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as 
				Att.
			 law-term, <i>copy of a declaration</i> made before a
			magistrate, <i>deposition</i> or <i>information</i> laid, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				9.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				29.1
			</span></i>, Lexap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				35.51
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιεῖσθαι ἀ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπογράφειν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				53.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὸς κατά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					1.23
				</span></i>
			, cf. Harp.s.v.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> any <i>written
				declaration</i> before a magistrate, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ποιείσθωσαν δηλοῦντες κτλ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					237 vii33
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, etc.; esp. <i>declaration</i> of property
			or persons liable to taxation, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1147.26
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
